# 第一千七百八十七部　Li 二阶曲率的精确模式展开

采用标准对称零点求和，Li 系数满足：

$$
\boxed{
\lambda_n
=
\sum_\rho
\left(
1-\omega_\rho^n
\right),
\qquad
n\ge1.
}
\tag{1787.1}
$$

并令：

$$
\lambda_0=0.
$$

定义二阶差分：

$$
\boxed{
d_n
=
\lambda_{n+1}
-2\lambda_n
+\lambda_{n-1},
\qquad
n\ge1.
}
\tag{1787.2}
$$

逐项计算：

$$
\begin{aligned}
d_n
&=
\sum_\rho
\left(
-\omega_\rho^{n+1}
+2\omega_\rho^n
-\omega_\rho^{n-1}
\right)\\
&=
-\sum_\rho
\omega_\rho^{n-1}
(\omega_\rho-1)^2.
\end{aligned}
$$

又因为：

$$
\omega_\rho-1=-\frac1\rho,
$$

所以：

$$
d_n
=
-\sum_\rho
\frac{\omega_\rho^{n-1}}{\rho^2}.
\tag{1787.3}
$$

